                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "children": [
                    "DISTINCT can require sorting or hashing."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "children": [
                    "Use it when duplicate removal is part of the question, not to hide an incorrect join."
                  ]
